  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Mission Agri-Business, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This trade mission aims to improve the bond between Bangladesh and The Netherlands and boost collaboration in agriculture, seeds &amp; horticulture, such as arable and protected horticulture, potato and floriculture, and Dairy, within the private sector and economy.Through the mission, the following goals can be achieved within these priority sub-sectors:&#x2022;	Business-to-business cooperation between Dutch and Bangladeshi small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) is stimulated by networking and matchmaking;&#x2022;	Focus is on trade and investments that benefit people, create jobs and preferably, are accompanied by the transfer of knowledge and skills;&#x2022;	Through business cooperation, the aim is to enhance food and nutritional security in Bangladesh by ensuring a consistent supply of quality agricultural inputs, including resilient varieties, promoting sustainable production technologies and appropriate mechanisation and storage.</narrative>
  </description>
